From: JiaY-shi <shi05275@163.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 00:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: allow firmware memory mode override from DT

ath12k selects the QCN9274 firmware memory mode from total system RAM.
That heuristic cannot describe embedded designs where a discrete radio has
to share memory and firmware resources with an integrated radio.

Allow the board DTS to select one of the existing QMI memory modes. Keep the
automatic RAM-based selection when the property is absent or invalid.

Signed-off-by: JiaY-shi <shi05275@163.com>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c
@@ -1773,9 +1773,22 @@ static void ath12k_core_reset(struct wor
 
 enum ath12k_qmi_mem_mode ath12k_core_get_memory_mode(struct ath12k_base *ab)
 {
+	u32 mode;
 	unsigned long total_ram;
 	struct sysinfo si;
 
+	if (!of_property_read_u32(ab->dev->of_node,
+				  "qcom,ath12k-fw-memory-mode", &mode)) {
+		if (mode <= ATH12K_QMI_MEMORY_MODE_LOW_512_M) {
+			ath12k_info(ab, "firmware memory mode %u from device tree\n",
+				    mode);
+			return (enum ath12k_qmi_mem_mode)mode;
+		}
+
+		ath12k_warn(ab, "ignoring unsupported firmware memory mode %u\n",
+			    mode);
+	}
+
 	si_meminfo(&si);
 	total_ram = si.totalram * si.mem_unit;
 
